$DATUM 2-(4-Allyl-4-methyl-2-oxo-1,4-dihydro-2H-benzo[d][1,3]oxazin-6-yl)-pyrrole-1-carboxylic
acid tert-butyl ester (9). Purified by flash chromatography (40-60%
EtOAc/hexane) to give a lightyellow solid (73%) that was recrystallized
from EtOAc/hexane, mp 95-97°C. 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 1.40 (s,
9H),1.72 (s, 3H), 2.66-2.73 (m, 2H), 5.12-5.15 (m, 2H), 5.73-5.80 (m,
1H), 6.15-6.16 (m, 1H), 6.21-6.22 (m, 1H), 6.89 (d, 1H, J = 8.0 Hz), 7.06
(d, 1H, J = 1.5 Hz), 7.22 (dd, 1H, J = 8.0, 1.5 Hz), 7.32-7.33 (m, 1H),
9.63 (brs, 1H). 13C NMR (125MHz, CDCl3) δ 26.51, 27.96, 45.82, 83.92,
85.01, 110.81, 114.16, 114.67, 120.19, 122.78, 123.87, 125.06, 129.79,
130.20, 131.74, 133.52, 134.42, 149.38, 153.30. MS m/e 368 (M+ , 30%).
HRMS (EI) calcd for C21H24N2O4 368.1736 (M+ ), found 368.1737.
