$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Step 3 A sealed tube was charged with tert-butyl
4-(4-iodo-1H-pyrazol-1-yl)piperidine-1-carboxylate (1.6 g, 4.3 mmol),
bis(pinacolato)diboron (1.5 g, 6.1 mmol), potassium acetate (1.70 g, 17.4
mmol), 1,1' bis(diphenylphosphino)ferrocene-palladium(II)dichloride-DCM
complex (0.2 g, 0.2 mmol), and DMSO (17 mL). The mixture was sparged with
argon for 10 min then heated to 80 °C for 3 h. The reaction mixture was
cooled to ambient temperature. The mixture was diluted with EtOAc and
filtered through celite. The filtrate was washed with brine and the
organic layer separated and dried over sodium sulfate. The solution was
concentrated in vacuo and purified by flash column chromatography (7-60%
EtOAc/hexane gradient) to afford 1.2 g of tert-butyl
4-[4-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-1H-pyrazol-1-yl]piperidine-1-carboxylate
(73%). 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.79 (s, 1H), 7.73 (s, 1H), 4.71-4.59
(m, 1H), 4.32-4.17 (m, 2H), 2.88 (m, 2H), 2.12 (m, 2H), 1.95-1.81 (m,
2H), 1.46 (s, 9H), 1.31 (s, 6H), 1.28-1.20 (s, 6H). LCMS (ESI) calc’d for
(C19H33BN3O4) [M+ H]+, 378.3; found 378.2.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM sealed tube used
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
